K1 MP Eco-Walk
Copyright 2026 Takeyuki-K (https://github.com/Takeyuki-K)

This product includes software and results developed by Takeyuki-K:
the concept and implementation of combining
  (1) a passive spring-return MP (metatarsophalangeal / toe) joint,
  (2) imitation of human walking data (hip-to-ankle retargeting + IK), and
  (3) learned joint relaxation (variable impedance: policy-selected Kp/Kd)
for energy-efficient humanoid walking.

